    "Helton Rhodes KA, Werner A. Blackwell’s DRUG(S) OF CHOICE •Ears should be thoroughly cleaned with a commercial ear cleaner. •Otic parasiticides should be used for",
    "Thomas RC. Treatment of ectoparasites. In: 7–10 days to eradicate mites and eggs; effective topical commercial products contain pyrethrins, thiabendazole, ivermectin, and milbemycin; treat during"
